msgid ""
"Two new resource blocks are available: \"IIIF Viewer\" (viewer embedded "
"inline in the page) and \"IIIF Viewer Button\" (button opening the viewer in "
"a full-page overlay). It embeds OpenSeadragon or the viewers of modules."
