msgid ""
"All features related to ocr, text and alto were moved to the module Iiif "
"Search. The module Iiif Search includes now automated processes to manage "
"all the common cases: search, highlight, extraction with or without provided "
"alto or pdf, extraction from images, tei and hocr, management of multi-pages "
"or single pages files, etc."
